### Get all weather reports as user
GET http://localhost:4000/weather

### Get one weather report as user
GET http://localhost:4000/weather/1

### Update user name and email
PATCH http://localhost:4000/users/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "Belaaaaa",
    "email": "belaaaaa@gmail.com",
    "luid": 2
}

### Change user password
POST http://localhost:4000/users/3/passmod
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "oldpass": "s",
    "newpass": "12345Ab!",
    "confirm": "12345Ab!"
}
